 radiation<br>\u25cf Repair and Craft, find mod schematics for your items<br>\u25cf Repair and upgrade vehicles to drive and defend<br>\u25cf Deal with many events with many possible outcomes<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085790/extras/1ebbdd11ece97498bceca011b82e5bc1.poster.avif?t=1745533620\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085790/extras/1ebbdd11ece97498bceca011b82e5bc1.webm?t=1745533620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085790/extras/1ebbdd11ece97498bceca011b82e5bc1.mp4?t=1745533620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
